    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bŏēthus</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>nom. prop.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A distinguished sculptor and engraver in
			silver</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 14, § 32</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin. 33, 12, 55</span></i>, §§
